{
    "title": "WWE World at WrestleMania",
    "description": "The WWE World app is your digital guide to all things WWE World at WrestleMania! Download the app to access panel schedules, Main Stage programming, Superstar and guest appearances, exhibitors, show features, and more.\r\n\r\nWWE World is the ultimate five-day fan experience happening alongside WrestleMania XL. Join us April 4-8 at the Pennsylvania Convention Center for an unforgettable event featuring WWE Superstars and Legends, exclusive merchandise, and interactive experiences. See live programming on the Main Stage, and re-live 40 years of WrestleMania history through memorabilia museums and immersive exhibits. Whether you\u2019re a casual or die-hard fan, WWE World\u2019s unique content and interactive fan experiences will captivate the entire WWE Universe unlike ever before.",
